    "source_pool": "CRL-CONTROL-DEV-POOL-001",
    "purpose": "Harvest independent ordinary-market open-position source states for CRL-006 synthetic shock testing without using later performance outcomes.",
    "revision_basis": "V1 exhausted the Development pool with insufficient source-state count before any CRL-006 synthetic shock outcomes were observed. V2 changes diagnostic state sampling only; it does not modify P4/P10 risk policy or forward evidence.",
    "selection_rule": "Scan chronologically in fixed 30-day research epochs anchored at the analysis-pool start. At each epoch boundary reset only Paper execution, portfolio, risk tracker and active setup; keep point-in-time market history continuous. Outside crisis exclusion buffers, retain at most one confirmed risk-allowed ENTER_LONG episode per epoch, first by decision_time_ms then symbol lexical order, until 10 episodes are selected. Selection may use entry occurrence only and must not inspect later PnL, drawdown, exit quality, recovery or future price path.",
